EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Of course.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Did you like it?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} I wrote
