TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ne demek.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beğendin mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} Sözlerin hepsini
