IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci per avermi mandato
quella bellissimissima poesia
scritta a mano l'altro giorno.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}The pacing and rhymes were nice.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}And I liked the part where you
compared the earth to a dung
beetle.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}It was very philosophical.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La metrica e le rime erano belle.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}E ho adooorato la parte in cui
paragoni la terra a uno scarabeo
stercorario.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Très philosophique.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Das Metrum und die Reime waren
sehr elegant.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Und inhaltlich fand
ich es sehr philosophisch.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Besonders der Teil, wo du die Erde
mit einem Mistkäfer vergleichst.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Das hat mir gut gefallen.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ritmi ve kafiyeleri güzeldi.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dünyayı bok
böceğine benzettiğin kısmı da sevdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Çok felsefiydi.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oui, j'avoue que je n'en suis pas
